documentacao API

### Get Access Token for User admin
POST  http://localhost:8080/realms/ecommerce/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin
&password=123456
&grant_type=password
&client_id=web-app
&scope=openid


### Get Access Token for User
POST  http://localhost:8080/realms/ecommerce/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=dev
&password=123456
&grant_type=password
&client_id=web-app
&scope=openid
# essa opção tem que esta marcado no client Direct access grant


### get token acess
# @name auth
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/ecommerce/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=api-customer-admin
&client_secret=hmyqNSACk1XYNvMcwWYW2Yscn4JZlTPW
&grant_type=client_credentials


###############################################
### 2) PEGAR O ACCESS TOKEN AUTOMATICAMENTE ###
###############################################
@token = {{auth.response.body.access_token}}


###create user in keycloak
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/ecommerce/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "davi",
  "email": "marckvaldo@hotmail.com",
  "enabled": true,
  "firstName": "João",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "emailVerified": false,
  "credentials": [
    {
      "type": "password",
      "value": "91020410@Php",
      "temporary": false
    }
  ]
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/dev/users?email=marckvaldo@hotmail.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### set useId
@userId = be124253-31d9-44ed-a016-9de0f2000b63

###send verification user email 
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/dev/users/{{userId}}/execute-actions-email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "VERIFY_EMAIL"
]


### list groups
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/dev/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### search group
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/dev/groups?search=customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### set groupId
@groupId = df11ae57-447d-4e74-94bb-81b55371c837

### add user to group
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/dev/users/{{userId}}/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### get public key
GET http://localhost:8080/realms/ecommerce/protocol/openid-connect/certs




